# The Python tools .cursor/install.sh sets up: the test packages and maturin,
# for `maturin develop` of the Python bindings. CI builds its wheels with
# PyO3/maturin-action instead.
# requirements-dev.txt pins these and every dependency with their hashes, and
# pip installs it with --require-hashes; after changing a pin here or in
# requirements-test.in, regenerate it with the uv command at its top.
-r requirements-test.in
maturin==1.16.0
